Dell Docking Station Research 


Background on Dell docking stations:

There are many types of Dell docking stations. 

1. Legacy E-Port Docking Stations 
Description: 
Legacy Dell E-Port docking stations are designed to be compatible with the older Dell Latitude and Precision laptop models. These laptops have a docking connector on the underside of the computer. Unlike the modernized USB-C docks, these docking stations can connect directly to the laptop without requiring a separate docking cable.

    Examples:
 1. Dell E-Port Replicator 
     Model: Pro01X

 2. Dell E0Port Plus Replicator 
     Model: Pr02X
 3. Dell E-Legacy Extender
     Model: Pr04X

 




